      "text": "All City employees not required to remain on duty for the protection of health and welfare services, for taking care of patients in municipal hospitals and homes, and police, fire and other essential services, will be given time off Friday, November 28th, the day after Thanksgiving. Friday, December 26th, the day after Christmas, and Friday, January 2nd, the day after the New Year.",
